3. Business Logic Flow

➕ Join Queue:
1. User requests token.
2. Backend:
• Checks current last token number.
• Adds 1 to generate new token.
• Saves token in DB with status = pending.

▶️ Call Next Token (Admin):
1. Admin calls /admin/next-token.
2. Backend:
• Finds next token with status = pending.
• Changes its status to active.
• Sends real-time notification.

🔔 Real-time Notifications:
• Use Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM), or WebSocket (Socket.IO):
• “You are next”
• “Token skipped”
• “Service delayed”

❌ Cancel/Expire Token:
• User or system can cancel/expire a token after a timeout (e.g., 5 mins if not present).

